window option, and mount my filesystems.  i wanted to try this now to see if
it's a good feature before i'm forced to try it because of file corruption,
etc.  i tried mounting my AdvFS domains and fsets and was unable to, and i
realized why after i tried (no /etc/fdmns directory?).

any way to make this work?  mounting AdvFS domains/fsets within the shell
window in the install CD?  or is this just a feature for UFS?

--Brandon

