The solution is to increase:
proc: maxusers (->2048)
or/and
proc: max-procs-per-user
proc: max-threads-per-user
proc: task-max
proc: thread-max

and... search in archives files (sorry), as
http://www.ornl.gov/its/archives/mailing-lists/tru64-unix-managers/2000/03/m
sg00252.html



