without any Kerberos ticket, I'm normaly prompted for the password and can
successfully log in.

If I issue 

  kinit

to get the ticket and then use "ssh", The client ends up wth a core dump:

OpenSSH_2.5.2p1, SSH protocols 1.5/2.0, OpenSSL 0x00906010
