Thanks to all who replied. The answer is:

Install card (any open PCI slot)
Boot -fi genvmunix  (I had been doing "cp genvmunix vmunix")
edit /sys/conf/MYHOST and add the line "config_driver isp"
rebuild the kernel "doconfig -c MYHOST" and move it into place
reboot

Thanks to John Mundt at Compaq.

